  abilities:
  - evidenceTypes: 
    description: When you give the command or when the Dark Spirit attacks you, Snorifik
      crashes to the ground. When the Dark Spirit steps on it, it slows down and
      may leave invisible footprints behind.
  - evidenceTypes: 04000000
    description: Snorifik detects <color=#F9AB2D>spiritual activity</color> around
      him and reveals its power. When he is pinned to the ground, his detection range
      increases.
